Try an ls of nethackdir.  Here's mine, for example:
 
bash-2.05a$ cd /usr/games/lib/nethackdir/ ; ls 
NetHack     bonD0.4.Z  bonM0.4.Z  nethack  pet_mark.xbm  save 
bonD0.12.Z  bonD0.5.Z  license    nhdat    record        x11tiles 
bonD0.23.Z  bonD0.8.Z  logfile    perm     recover

The files starting with 'bon' are the bones files.  Just as a note,
though, you have to die below dlvl 3 to leave bones, and some special
levels are also ineligible.  Also, any given death has only a 50% chance
of leaving bones, IIRC.  Maybe you've just been (un)lucky.

Checking in wizmode wouldn't be a bad idea, but my guess is that bones
will eventually appear.  I've never had them stop working, at least.
Your mileage may vary.  ^_~

